{"step_index":353,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T04:11:07Z","thinking":"`selectedProjectId` appears exclusively in the state initialization and as the `<select>`'s value attribute. This variable isn't used to filter or display the newly created project. The user reports a project creation success message, yet the project name does not appear. This suggests a disconnect between the project creation logic and the display logic, specifically regarding the selected project.\n\n\nThe absence of the newly created project name on the Gantt chart suggests that either the project ID is not correctly associated with the displayed `ganttItems`, or there's a filtering issue preventing the project's data from being shown. It is essential to verify if the project creation process correctly updates the selected project and associates the new project's data with the displayed Gantt chart. Examination of the data storage and project creation controller code is needed to pinpoint the cause of the data display discrepancy.\n\n\nThe project creation logic in the backend successfully adds new projects to the database, as confirmed by the success message. However, the unexpected disappearance of `ganttItems` and `tasks` from the data store suggests a potential issue in the data read/write operations or in the data model itself, despite project creation succeeding. The code responsible for reading and writing the database needs thorough examination to identify why the data is being lost or modified unexpectedly.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass; $env:PATH = \"C:\\Program Files\\nodejs;\" + $env:PATH; node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst seed = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/GiaWyy/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aps-project-manager/backend/data/seed.json', 'utf-8'));\nconsole.log('Projects:', seed.projects.length);\nconsole.log('Employees:', seed.employees.length);\nconsole.log('Tasks:', seed.tasks.length);\nconsole.log('GanttItems:', seed.ganttItems.length);\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\GiaWyy\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aps-project-manager","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking seed.json contents","toolSummary":"Check seed counts"}}]}
