{"step_index":369,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T04:13:11Z","thinking":"The initial update requires modifying the `createProject` function. The function currently retrieves data from the request body and performs a basic validation for the project name. A new project object is constructed using this data.\n\n```javascript\n  const newProject = {\n    id: `proj-${Date.now()}`\n    name,\n    code,\n    description,\n    location,\n    manager,\n    startDate,\n    endDate\n  };\n  db.projects.push(newProject);\n  writeDb(db);\n  res.status(201).json({ success: true, project: newProject });\n}\n```\n\nIn `createGanttItem`:\n```javascript\nexport function createGanttItem(req, res) {\n  const db = readDb();\n  const { projectId, text, start_date, duration, progress, dependencies } = req.body;\n\n  if (!projectId || !text || !start_date || !duration) {\n    return res.status(400).json({ success: false, message: 'Vui lòng điền đầy đủ thông tin' });\n  }\n\n  const newGanttItem = {\n    id: `item-${Date.now()}`,\n    projectId,\n    text,\n    start_date,\n    duration,\n    progress: progress || 0,\n    dependencies: dependencies || ''\n  };\n  db.ganttItems.push(newGanttItem);\n  writeDb(db);\n  res.status(201).json({ success: true, ganttItem: newGanttItem });\n}\n```\nNow, update `createGanttItem` function. The function retrieves data from the request body and performs basic input validations. A new Gantt item object is constructed with this data and assigned default values if certain fields are missing.\n\n\nA new project object with default values and auto-generated code will be created. Initial Gantt chart items are generated, including a root item, a phase item and an initial task. A corresponding task is also created for the assigned employee.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Enhance createProject to create initial Gantt items so new projects immediately show on the board","EndLine":115,"Instruction":"When creating a project, initialize root project item and initial phases so it immediately shows up on Gantt.","ReplacementContent":"// Tạo dự án mới\nexport function createProject(req, res) {\n  const db = readDb();\n  const { name, code, description, location, manager, startDate, endDate } = req.body;\n\n  if (!name) {\n    return res.status(400).json({ success: false, message: 'Vui lòng nhập tên dự án' });\n  }\n\n  const newProject = {\n    id: `proj-${Date.now()}`,\n    code: code || `APS-${new Date().getFullYear()}-${db.projects.length + 1}`,\n    name,\n    description: description || '',\n    location: location || 'Hà Nội',\n    manager: manager || 'Trần Quốc Hưng',\n    startDate: startDate || new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0],\n    endDate: endDate || '2027-12-31',\n    status: 'planning',\n    progress: 0\n  };\n\n  db.projects.push(newProject);\n\n  // Tự động khởi tạo ngay hàng Dự Án gốc và các giai đoạn khởi đầu trên bảng Gantt\n  const startD = new Date(newProject.startDate);\n  const endD = new Date(newProject.endDate);\n  const totalDays = Math.max(1, Math.round((endD - startD) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24)) + 1);\n\n  const rootItem = {\n    id: `G-${newProject.id}`,\n    projectId: newProject.id,\n    code: newProject.code,\n    title: newProject.name,\n    isGroup: true,\n    color: '#0284c7',\n    unit: 'BQL',\n    startDate: newProject.startDate,\n    endDate: newProject.endDate,\n    days: totalDays,\n    assignee: newProject.manager,\n    notes: newProject.location || 'Dự án mới tạo',\n    status: 'planning',\n    speed: 'on_time',\n    progress: 0,\n    dependencies: []\n  };\n\n  const phaseA = {\n    id: `G-${newProject.id}-A`,\n    projectId: newProject.id,\n    code: 'A',\n    title: 'A. THIẾT KẾ XÂY DỰNG',\n    isGroup: true,\n    color: '#0284c7',\n    unit: 'TK',\n    startDate: newProject.startDate,\n    endDate: newProject.endDate,\n    days: Math.round(totalDays * 0.4),\n    assignee: newProject.manager,\n    notes: 'Giai đoạn thiết kế',\n    status: 'planning',\n    speed: 'on_time',\n    progress: 0,\n    dependencies: []\n  };\n\n  const taskA1 = {\n    id: `G-${newProject.id}-A1`,\n    projectId: newProject.id,\n    code: 'A1',\n    title: 'Khảo sát hiện trạng & Lập nhiệm vụ thiết kế',\n    isGroup: false,\n    color: '#38bdf8',\n    unit: 'TK',\n    startDate: newProject.startDate,\n    endDate: new Date(startD.getTime() + 7 * 86400000).toISOString().split('T')[0],\n    days: 7,\n    assignee: newProject.manager,\n    notes: 'Khởi động dự án mới',\n    status: 'in_progress',\n    speed: 'on_time',\n    progress: 0,\n    dependencies: []\n  };\n\n  if (!db.ganttItems) db.ganttItems = [];\n  db.ganttItems.push(rootItem, phaseA, taskA1);\n\n  // Tạo luôn 1 task trong db.tasks cho nhân sự phụ trách\n  const empNameNorm = (newProject.manager || '').trim().toLowerCase();\n  const emp = db.employees.find(e => e.name.trim().toLowerCase() === empNameNorm) || db.employees[0];\n  if (!db.tasks) db.tasks = [];\n  db.tasks.push({\n    id: `task-${Date.now()}`,\n    ganttId: taskA1.id,\n    projectId: newProject.id,\n    projectName: newProject.name,\n    phase: 'A. THIẾT KẾ XÂY DỰNG',\n    code: 'A1',\n    title: taskA1.title,\n    employeeId: emp ? emp.id : 'emp-1',\n    employeeName: emp ? emp.name : newProject.manager,\n    startDate: taskA1.startDate,\n    endDate: taskA1.endDate,\n    estimatedHours: 56,\n    estimatedDays: 7,\n    status: 'in_progress',\n    speedStatus: 'on_time',\n    priority: 'high',\n    progress: 0,\n    notes: 'Nhiệm vụ khởi động dự án'\n  });\n\n  writeDb(db);\n\n  return res.status(201).json({\n    success: true,\n    message: `Đã tạo dự án \"${newProject.name}\" thành công và hiển thị tiến độ ban đầu lên bảng`,\n    data: newProject\n  });\n}","StartLine":82,"TargetContent":"// Tạo dự án mới\nexport function createProject(req, res) {\n  const db = readDb();\n  const { name, code, description, location, manager, startDate, endDate } = req.body;\n\n  if (!name) {\n    return res.status(400).json({ success: false, message: 'Vui lòng nhập tên dự án' });\n  }\n\n  const newProject = {\n    id: `proj-${Date.now()}`,\n    code: code || `APS-${new Date().getFullYear()}-${db.projects.length + 1}`,\n    name,\n    description: description || '',\n    location: location || 'Hà Nội',\n    manager: manager || 'Trần Quốc Hưng',\n    startDate: startDate || new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0],\n    endDate: endDate || '2027-12-31',\n    status: 'planning',\n    progress: 0\n  };\n\n  db.projects.push(newProject);\n  writeDb(db);\n\n  return res.status(201).json({\n    success: true,\n    message: 'Tạo dự án mới thành công',\n    data: newProject\n  });\n}","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\GiaWyy\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\aps-project-manager\\backend\\src\\controllers\\projectController.js","toolAction":"Updating createProject in projectController","toolSummary":"Enhance createProject with Gantt items"}}]}
